1
00:00:00,550 --> 00:00:04,253
Meet Easy. A desktop file converter that brings the right format to

2
00:00:04,253 --> 00:00:07,647
your cursor. Built on the open source Filee project, this customized

3
00:00:07,647 --> 00:00:10,424
Mac app turns everyday conversion into a simple gesture.

4
00:00:11,783 --> 00:00:15,641
Hold Option, drag a file, and choose a format from the ring.

5
00:00:15,641 --> 00:00:18,212
Drop onto your choice, and Easy starts converting.

6
00:00:18,212 --> 00:00:22,070
The available choices adapt to your files, so your workflow stays focused.

7
00:00:23,450 --> 00:00:27,130
Images, documents, spreadsheets, presentations, and PDFs share one

8
00:00:27,130 --> 00:00:31,731
workflow. The engine catalog also covers e books, archives, subtitles,

9
00:00:31,731 --> 00:00:35,871
fonts, structured data, CAD drawings, and three dimensional models.

10
00:00:35,871 --> 00:00:40,011
Support depends on the format, route, and available engine.

11
00:00:41,383 --> 00:00:45,319
Turn images into web friendly formats, resize them, or build a PDF.

12
00:00:45,319 --> 00:00:49,254
Merge documents, split pages, select a page range, or compress a PDF.

13
00:00:49,254 --> 00:00:53,189
Extract text or page images for the next step in your work.

14
00:00:54,550 --> 00:00:56,293
Easy adds an ONLYOFFICE integration.

15
00:00:56,293 --> 00:01:00,476
With Desktop Editors installed and opened once on your Mac, Word, PowerPoint,

16
00:01:00,476 --> 00:01:03,962
and Excel files can become PDFs through its rendering engine.

17
00:01:03,962 --> 00:01:07,449
Font checks and conversion logs help identify substitutions that may

18
00:01:07,449 --> 00:01:08,494
affect the result.

19
00:01:09,850 --> 00:01:13,768
For PDF to Word, Easy rebuilds positioned text into paragraphs, headings,

20
00:01:13,768 --> 00:01:17,330
and tables. The result is a document you can edit.

21
00:01:17,330 --> 00:01:21,248
Layout can reflow, and equations become text with subscript and superscript,

22
00:01:21,248 --> 00:01:23,029
rather than editable equation objects.

23
00:01:24,383 --> 00:01:26,983
Add FFmpeg for video and audio.

24
00:01:26,983 --> 00:01:31,316
Convert video formats, extract audio, create animated GIFs, or export

25
00:01:31,316 --> 00:01:34,782
frames. Presets control quality, resolution, and compatible codecs.

26
00:01:34,782 --> 00:01:39,114
Text subtitles can also be converted, with hardware encoding available

27
00:01:39,114 --> 00:01:40,414
for supported setups.

28
00:01:41,783 --> 00:01:44,200
Create a toolbar for each file type.

29
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:47,998
Reorder its options, then save presets for quality, size, PDF pages,

30
00:01:47,998 --> 00:01:51,106
and compression. Choose the output folder and naming rules.

31
00:01:51,106 --> 00:01:54,558
Light and dark themes let the workspace match your preferences.

32
00:01:55,917 --> 00:01:58,466
Drop several files to process them in parallel.

33
00:01:58,466 --> 00:02:00,378
Watch folders automatically convert new arrivals.

34
00:02:00,378 --> 00:02:04,202
The filee command line exposes the same engines and presets for scripts.

35
00:02:04,202 --> 00:02:07,707
Progress and recent conversions help you follow the work from start

36
00:02:07,707 --> 00:02:08,344
to finish.

37
00:02:09,717 --> 00:02:13,764
Under the hood, Easy plans a route between formats, including conversions

38
00:02:13,764 --> 00:02:17,443
with intermediate steps. A job queue manages engine concurrency, and

39
00:02:17,443 --> 00:02:19,283
engine priority resolves competing choices.

40
00:02:19,283 --> 00:02:23,330
Built in, bundled, and optional tools work together behind the same

41
00:02:23,330 --> 00:02:23,698
interface.

42
00:02:25,050 --> 00:02:27,854
Conversion runs locally, without uploading your files.

43
00:02:27,854 --> 00:02:31,459
Once the required engines are available, conversion works offline.

44
00:02:31,459 --> 00:02:35,063
Results normally appear beside the originals, with configurable destinations.

45
00:02:35,063 --> 00:02:37,467
Source files are protected from overwrite.

46
00:02:37,467 --> 00:02:40,671
Optional engine downloads still need an internet connection.

47
00:02:42,050 --> 00:02:44,610
Easy combines quick conversions, reusable presets, and automation,

48
00:02:44,610 --> 00:02:46,851
with added document handling for the Mac.

49
00:02:46,851 --> 00:02:51,011
From one image to a folder of reports: choose your format, keep control

50
00:02:51,011 --> 00:02:53,892
of your files, and get back to your work.